  "estimatedLength": "35 minutes",
  "objectives": [
    "Represent a 2D vector by its magnitude and direction, and equivalently by its horizontal and vertical components.",
    "Add vectors geometrically using the tip-to-tail method and interpret the resultant\u2019s direction.",
    "Decompose and reconstruct vectors along x- and y-axes using right-triangle relationships (sin/cos).",
    "Explain projectile motion independence: horizontal motion unaffected by gravity; vertical motion accelerated by gravity.",
    "Describe how projectile horizontal/vertical velocity and position evolve; identify maximum height when vy = 0.",
    "Predict and compare how changing launch angle and launch speed changes range and maximum height; identify the intermediate angle that maximizes range for fixed speed."
  ],
